// desert (流沙荒漠) ground decals + standing decor — low-contrast sand-tone decals
// (a) 9 ground decal_desert_* sprites: transparent-bg texture marks, ±10-18% off
//     the biome floor tones (P.dune/P.sand/P.sandD — biomes.js desert floor is
//     '#caa260'/floor2 '#d8b46a' == P.dune), no outline, no bright green/teal.
//     Only 2 carry a faint warm glint (shimmer + micaglint), both small/low-alpha.
// (b) 4 standing bdx_desert_* props: dead scrub / weathered urn / half-buried
//     broken column / sun-baked rock pile, same finish convention as the
//     existing bd_desert_* set (softShadow -> body -> rimLight -> outline).

// ── (a) ground decals ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
